[
  {
    "segment_id": "s00001",
    "start_seconds": 0.24,
    "end_seconds": 3.84,
    "text": "Last week, the JavaScript runtime wars"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00002",
    "start_seconds": 2.24,
    "end_seconds": 5.68,
    "text": "officially ended when the guy who put"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00003",
    "start_seconds": 3.84,
    "end_seconds": 7.6,
    "text": "JavaScript on the server and then spent"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00004",
    "start_seconds": 5.68,
    "end_seconds": 9.44,
    "text": "the next decade atoning for it announced"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00005",
    "start_seconds": 7.6,
    "end_seconds": 11.36,
    "text": "that his company Dino was joining"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00006",
    "start_seconds": 9.44,
    "end_seconds": 13.12,
    "text": "Cloudflare. And on paper, it looks like"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00007",
    "start_seconds": 11.36,
    "end_seconds": 14.799,
    "text": "a pretty traditional Silicon Valley"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00008",
    "start_seconds": 13.12,
    "end_seconds": 16.56,
    "text": "acquisition where the founder says"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00009",
    "start_seconds": 14.799,
    "end_seconds": 17.919999999999998,
    "text": "they're excited for the future. The"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00010",
    "start_seconds": 16.56,
    "end_seconds": 19.759999999999998,
    "text": "company says they're excited about the"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00011",
    "start_seconds": 17.92,
    "end_seconds": 21.92,
    "text": "mission and the employees learn the hard"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00012",
    "start_seconds": 19.76,
    "end_seconds": 23.68,
    "text": "way what a Pruff Stack is. But if you"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00013",
    "start_seconds": 21.92,
    "end_seconds": 25.519000000000002,
    "text": "think about it, it's a little weird that"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00014",
    "start_seconds": 23.68,
    "end_seconds": 27.439,
    "text": "a company which already has its own"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00015",
    "start_seconds": 25.519,
    "end_seconds": 29.439,
    "text": "runtime and deployment platform would"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00016",
    "start_seconds": 27.439,
    "end_seconds": 31.198999999999998,
    "text": "buy a worse one. In today's video, we'll"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00017",
    "start_seconds": 29.439,
    "end_seconds": 33.2,
    "text": "find out what Cloudflare actually paid"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00018",
    "start_seconds": 31.199,
    "end_seconds": 35.44,
    "text": "for, learn why Ryan Doll now thinks"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00019",
    "start_seconds": 33.2,
    "end_seconds": 37.2,
    "text": "re-implementing Node was a bad idea, and"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00020",
    "start_seconds": 35.44,
    "end_seconds": 39.599999999999994,
    "text": "dive into what the future of Dino looks"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00021",
    "start_seconds": 37.2,
    "end_seconds": 42.399,
    "text": "like now. And spoiler alert, it's not so"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00022",
    "start_seconds": 39.6,
    "end_seconds": 44.239000000000004,
    "text": "good. It is October 15th, 2026, and"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00023",
    "start_seconds": 42.399,
    "end_seconds": 48.079,
    "text": "you're watching the code report. Back in"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00024",
    "start_seconds": 44.239,
    "end_seconds": 50.16,
    "text": "2009, Ryan Doll got on stage at JSCOM EU"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00025",
    "start_seconds": 48.079,
    "end_seconds": 52.480000000000004,
    "text": "and introduced the world to a new open-"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00026",
    "start_seconds": 50.16,
    "end_seconds": 54.16,
    "text": "source runtime called Node.js that"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00027",
    "start_seconds": 52.48,
    "end_seconds": 56.0,
    "text": "allowed you to write JavaScript on the"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00028",
    "start_seconds": 54.16,
    "end_seconds": 58.48,
    "text": "server. Nine years later, he went back"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00029",
    "start_seconds": 56.0,
    "end_seconds": 60.239,
    "text": "to that same stage with a talk titled 10"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00030",
    "start_seconds": 58.48,
    "end_seconds": 62.07899999999999,
    "text": "things I regret about Node, where he"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00031",
    "start_seconds": 60.239,
    "end_seconds": 64.08,
    "text": "spent most of the time tearing apart the"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00032",
    "start_seconds": 62.079,
    "end_seconds": 66.08,
    "text": "original project before revealing that"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00033",
    "start_seconds": 64.08,
    "end_seconds": 67.76,
    "text": "he recreated it from scratch, but this"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00034",
    "start_seconds": 66.08,
    "end_seconds": 70.08,
    "text": "time without all the regret. He called"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00035",
    "start_seconds": 67.76,
    "end_seconds": 72.08000000000001,
    "text": "it Dino and unlike Node, it came with"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00036",
    "start_seconds": 70.08,
    "end_seconds": 74.08,
    "text": "its own formatter, llinter, and"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00037",
    "start_seconds": 72.08,
    "end_seconds": 75.84,
    "text": "testrunner that supported TypeScript,"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00038",
    "start_seconds": 74.08,
    "end_seconds": 77.52,
    "text": "was secure by default, and had a"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00039",
    "start_seconds": 75.84,
    "end_seconds": 79.759,
    "text": "sensible way to manage external"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00040",
    "start_seconds": 77.52,
    "end_seconds": 82.79899999999999,
    "text": "packages. Adino 1.0 0 launched a few"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00041",
    "start_seconds": 79.759,
    "end_seconds": 84.88,
    "text": "years later in 2020 and by 2021 Ryan"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00042",
    "start_seconds": 82.799,
    "end_seconds": 87.2,
    "text": "announced their serverless platform Dino"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00043",
    "start_seconds": 84.88,
    "end_seconds": 88.96,
    "text": "Deploy along with a fresh $5 million"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00044",
    "start_seconds": 87.2,
    "end_seconds": 90.88000000000001,
    "text": "seed round and initially things were"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00045",
    "start_seconds": 88.96,
    "end_seconds": 92.39999999999999,
    "text": "going great and Netlefi and Superbase"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00046",
    "start_seconds": 90.88,
    "end_seconds": 94.56,
    "text": "built their edge functions on top of"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00047",
    "start_seconds": 92.4,
    "end_seconds": 97.119,
    "text": "Dino and Slack used it to power their"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00048",
    "start_seconds": 94.56,
    "end_seconds": 99.2,
    "text": "new app platform. The next year in 2022"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00049",
    "start_seconds": 97.119,
    "end_seconds": 101.28,
    "text": "they got 21 million in series A funding"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00050",
    "start_seconds": 99.2,
    "end_seconds": 102.799,
    "text": "from Sequoia launched a web framework"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00051",
    "start_seconds": 101.28,
    "end_seconds": 104.4,
    "text": "called Fresh and it was looking like"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00052",
    "start_seconds": 102.799,
    "end_seconds": 106.47900000000001,
    "text": "they had a real shot at becoming the"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00053",
    "start_seconds": 104.4,
    "end_seconds": 108.64,
    "text": "future of serverside JavaScript. But"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00054",
    "start_seconds": 106.479,
    "end_seconds": 110.96,
    "text": "then their momentum died. Their biggest"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00055",
    "start_seconds": 108.64,
    "end_seconds": 113.28,
    "text": "problem being that Node didn't just roll"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00056",
    "start_seconds": 110.96,
    "end_seconds": 115.52,
    "text": "over. During those same few years, Node"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00057",
    "start_seconds": 113.28,
    "end_seconds": 117.04,
    "text": "added fetch, a permission model, and the"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00058",
    "start_seconds": 115.52,
    "end_seconds": 119.119,
    "text": "ability to run TypeScript files"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00059",
    "start_seconds": 117.04,
    "end_seconds": 120.47900000000001,
    "text": "directly. So, Dino lost its edge."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00060",
    "start_seconds": 119.119,
    "end_seconds": 122.0,
    "text": "Meanwhile, the products that were"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00061",
    "start_seconds": 120.479,
    "end_seconds": 123.6,
    "text": "supposed to make money weren't gaining"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00062",
    "start_seconds": 122.0,
    "end_seconds": 126.159,
    "text": "enough traction to justify the"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00063",
    "start_seconds": 123.6,
    "end_seconds": 129.119,
    "text": "valuation. Adino Deploy went from 35"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00064",
    "start_seconds": 126.159,
    "end_seconds": 131.76000000000002,
    "text": "regions down to six. Dino KV launched in"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00065",
    "start_seconds": 129.119,
    "end_seconds": 133.36,
    "text": "2023 and never made it out of beta. And"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00066",
    "start_seconds": 131.76,
    "end_seconds": 135.67999999999998,
    "text": "Fresh started going months between"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00067",
    "start_seconds": 133.36,
    "end_seconds": 137.44000000000003,
    "text": "releases. At the same time, Ryan took on"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00068",
    "start_seconds": 135.68,
    "end_seconds": 139.04000000000002,
    "text": "a legal fight with Oracle over the"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00069",
    "start_seconds": 137.44,
    "end_seconds": 140.4,
    "text": "JavaScript trademark, which Oracle"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00070",
    "start_seconds": 139.04,
    "end_seconds": 142.64,
    "text": "inherited when it bought Sun"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00071",
    "start_seconds": 140.4,
    "end_seconds": 144.56,
    "text": "Microsystems the same year Ryan created"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00072",
    "start_seconds": 142.64,
    "end_seconds": 146.64,
    "text": "Node. It was a noble cause, but a"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00073",
    "start_seconds": 144.56,
    "end_seconds": 148.56,
    "text": "GoFundMe for trademark lawyers probably"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00074",
    "start_seconds": 146.64,
    "end_seconds": 150.72,
    "text": "isn't what Sequoia had in mind when they"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00075",
    "start_seconds": 148.56,
    "end_seconds": 152.4,
    "text": "wrote a $21 million check. The sentiment"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00076",
    "start_seconds": 150.72,
    "end_seconds": 154.16,
    "text": "got bad enough last year that a"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00077",
    "start_seconds": 152.4,
    "end_seconds": 155.92000000000002,
    "text": "developer named David Bushell wrote a"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00078",
    "start_seconds": 154.16,
    "end_seconds": 157.76,
    "text": "blog post declaring that Dena was"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00079",
    "start_seconds": 155.92,
    "end_seconds": 159.83999999999997,
    "text": "basically dead since every new release"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00080",
    "start_seconds": 157.76,
    "end_seconds": 161.599,
    "text": "was just more node compatibility fixes"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00081",
    "start_seconds": 159.84,
    "end_seconds": 163.519,
    "text": "in an endless game of ketchup. And"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00082",
    "start_seconds": 161.599,
    "end_seconds": 165.2,
    "text": "ironically, Ryan had come to the same"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00083",
    "start_seconds": 163.519,
    "end_seconds": 167.04,
    "text": "conclusion. He just took a little bit"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00084",
    "start_seconds": 165.2,
    "end_seconds": 169.04,
    "text": "longer to get there. So earlier this"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00085",
    "start_seconds": 167.04,
    "end_seconds": 171.28,
    "text": "year, the team started to look at hard"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00086",
    "start_seconds": 169.04,
    "end_seconds": 173.2,
    "text": "problems that live outside the runtime,"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00087",
    "start_seconds": 171.28,
    "end_seconds": 175.28,
    "text": "like spreading compute across machines,"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00088",
    "start_seconds": 173.2,
    "end_seconds": 177.28,
    "text": "coordinating state, and scaling. And the"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00089",
    "start_seconds": 175.28,
    "end_seconds": 179.04,
    "text": "best answer they found was Cloudflare's"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00090",
    "start_seconds": 177.28,
    "end_seconds": 181.04,
    "text": "durable objects, which if you're not"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00091",
    "start_seconds": 179.04,
    "end_seconds": 182.959,
    "text": "familiar with are basically tiny"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00092",
    "start_seconds": 181.04,
    "end_seconds": 185.2,
    "text": "singlethreaded servers that each get"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00093",
    "start_seconds": 182.959,
    "end_seconds": 186.8,
    "text": "their own private SQLite database and"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00094",
    "start_seconds": 185.2,
    "end_seconds": 188.159,
    "text": "the ability to hold websocket"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00095",
    "start_seconds": 186.8,
    "end_seconds": 190.239,
    "text": "connections. But the problem with"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00096",
    "start_seconds": 188.159,
    "end_seconds": 192.48,
    "text": "durable objects is that they really only"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00097",
    "start_seconds": 190.239,
    "end_seconds": 194.239,
    "text": "work on Cloudflare. So in August, the"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00098",
    "start_seconds": 192.48,
    "end_seconds": 196.23899999999998,
    "text": "Dino team released their own version"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00099",
    "start_seconds": 194.239,
    "end_seconds": 198.64000000000001,
    "text": "they called cell D, which lets you run"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00100",
    "start_seconds": 196.239,
    "end_seconds": 200.64000000000001,
    "text": "durable objects on your own servers at a"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00101",
    "start_seconds": 198.64,
    "end_seconds": 202.39999999999998,
    "text": "fraction of the cost. And surprisingly,"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00102",
    "start_seconds": 200.64,
    "end_seconds": 204.23899999999998,
    "text": "Cloudflare was happy to be ripped off"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00103",
    "start_seconds": 202.4,
    "end_seconds": 206.239,
    "text": "like this. In the announcement post, the"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00104",
    "start_seconds": 204.239,
    "end_seconds": 208.239,
    "text": "creator of Cloudflare Workers said that"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00105",
    "start_seconds": 206.239,
    "end_seconds": 210.48000000000002,
    "text": "people have always accused Cloudflare of"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00106",
    "start_seconds": 208.239,
    "end_seconds": 212.31900000000002,
    "text": "using workers to lock in developers, but"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00107",
    "start_seconds": 210.48,
    "end_seconds": 214.319,
    "text": "the workers runtime has been open source"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00108",
    "start_seconds": 212.319,
    "end_seconds": 216.23899999999998,
    "text": "since 2022 and that they've wanted to"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00109",
    "start_seconds": 214.319,
    "end_seconds": 218.159,
    "text": "build a self-hostable version for years,"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00110",
    "start_seconds": 216.239,
    "end_seconds": 219.84,
    "text": "but just never got around to it. He even"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00111",
    "start_seconds": 218.159,
    "end_seconds": 221.519,
    "text": "admitted he tried building one himself"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00112",
    "start_seconds": 219.84,
    "end_seconds": 223.20000000000002,
    "text": "last spring and he couldn't get it to"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00113",
    "start_seconds": 221.519,
    "end_seconds": 225.20000000000002,
    "text": "work. So, when the Dino team figured it"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00114",
    "start_seconds": 223.2,
    "end_seconds": 227.67999999999998,
    "text": "out with Cell D, Cloudflare did what"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00115",
    "start_seconds": 225.2,
    "end_seconds": 229.35999999999999,
    "text": "anyone with a $123 billion market cap"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00116",
    "start_seconds": 227.68,
    "end_seconds": 231.519,
    "text": "would do and they just bought the whole"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00117",
    "start_seconds": 229.36,
    "end_seconds": 234.08,
    "text": "company. The plan is to have Ryan and"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00118",
    "start_seconds": 231.519,
    "end_seconds": 235.59900000000002,
    "text": "co-founder Bert Belder merge celld into"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00119",
    "start_seconds": 234.08,
    "end_seconds": 237.519,
    "text": "Cloudflare's open- source workers"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00120",
    "start_seconds": 235.599,
    "end_seconds": 239.76,
    "text": "runtime is so that anyone can run"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00121",
    "start_seconds": 237.519,
    "end_seconds": 241.439,
    "text": "workers and durable objects on their own"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00122",
    "start_seconds": 239.76,
    "end_seconds": 243.2,
    "text": "servers with official support from"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00123",
    "start_seconds": 241.439,
    "end_seconds": 244.72,
    "text": "Cloudflare. And because we can't go a"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00124",
    "start_seconds": 243.2,
    "end_seconds": 246.95899999999997,
    "text": "whole video without talking about it,"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00125",
    "start_seconds": 244.72,
    "end_seconds": 248.72,
    "text": "Ryan says the big focus is AI agents"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00126",
    "start_seconds": 246.959,
    "end_seconds": 250.959,
    "text": "because durable objects are a natural"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00127",
    "start_seconds": 248.72,
    "end_seconds": 252.64,
    "text": "fit for agents that need cheap compute,"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00128",
    "start_seconds": 250.959,
    "end_seconds": 254.56,
    "text": "persistent state, and real-time"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00129",
    "start_seconds": 252.64,
    "end_seconds": 256.4,
    "text": "connections. But unfortunately, if"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00130",
    "start_seconds": 254.56,
    "end_seconds": 259.04,
    "text": "you're using any Dino product that isn't"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00131",
    "start_seconds": 256.4,
    "end_seconds": 260.799,
    "text": "CLD, you are screwed. Cloudflare says"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00132",
    "start_seconds": 259.04,
    "end_seconds": 262.72,
    "text": "they'll only continue to ship bug fixes"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00133",
    "start_seconds": 260.799,
